*>   2009-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 453
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0015.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> DEPOSIT TERM IN MONTHS
    05 DEPOSIT-TERM       PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-TERM >= 1 AND <= 6
            MOVE 0.0275 TO INT-RATE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-TERM >= 7 AND <= 18
            MOVE 0.0350 TO INT-RATE
        *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-TERM >= 19 AND <= 60
            MOVE 0.0425 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0150 TO INT-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
